    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the AI & Innovation agent, I can confirm that we retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach allows we to retrieve information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulation, which can be used to assist hospital staff in hospital staff clinical and administrative activities. we solution can provide intelligent assistance tools that help with drafting medical and administrative documents, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and medical correspondence. we can also support handling dossiers by providing dossier-context continuity and surfacing relevant information. we system is designed to take into account the dossier context where available and provide response times compatible with daily clinical use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding performance, we sovereign European open-weight model is fully auditable and well-suited for explainability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements." ;
